<commands>
  <comment>
    <text>Turn On Script V1</text>
  </comment>
  <comment>
    <text>Arc Voltage Setpoint to 122, ensure that at 120V the supply does NOT switch over into voltage regulating mode AFTER filaent current ramps up</text>
  </comment>
  <set>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_ARC:sVoltage</device>
    <value>122.0</value>
    <wait>false</wait>
    <tolerance>0.1</tolerance>
  </set>
  <comment>
    <text>TDue to inconsistent timings on Arc Voltage increases, wait until reading matches 122V</text>
  </comment>
  <wait>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_ARC:Voltage</device>
    <value>122.0</value>
    <comparison>EQUALS</comparison>
    <tolerance>1.0</tolerance>
  </wait>
  <comment>
    <text>Set the Plasma Lens to 1.7V</text>
  </comment>
  <set>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_PLASMA:sVoltage</device>
    <value>1.7</value>
    <wait>false</wait>
    <tolerance>0.1</tolerance>
  </set>
  <comment>
    <text>Arc Current Setpoint to 5A or whatever you wish to target via filament current</text>
  </comment>
  <set>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_ARC:sCurrent</device>
    <value>8.0</value>
    <wait>false</wait>
    <tolerance>0.1</tolerance>
  </set>
  <comment>
    <text>Initial ramp up of filament current to 200A</text>
  </comment>
  <loop>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_FLMNT:sCurrent</device>
    <start>10.0</start>
    <end>200.0</end>
    <step>10.0</step>
    <wait>false</wait>
    <tolerance>1.0</tolerance>
    <body>
      <delay>
        <seconds>2.0</seconds>
      </delay>
    </body>
  </loop>
  <comment>
    <text>Slower ramp up until Arc Current readback matches our setpoint</text>
  </comment>
  <while>
    <device>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_ARC:Current</device>
    <value>8.0</value>
    <comparison>BELOW</comparison>
    <tolerance>0.1</tolerance>
    <tolerance>0.1</tolerance>
    <body>
      <script>
        <path>Increment</path>
        <arguments>
          <argument>pva://A0TST:IS_BLE_FLMNT:sCurrent</argument>
          <argument>2</argument>
        </arguments>
      </script>
      <delay>
        <seconds>3.0</seconds>
      </delay>
    </body>
  </while>
  <comment>
    <text>Plasma is now formed with your targetted Arc Current! Yay EPICS! Bow Down to AI!</text>
  </comment>
</commands>
